A note on the reference material.

The archetypes documented in references/caption-patterns.md and
references/visual-archetypes.md were derived by analysing publicly posted
LinkedIn content. They describe structural patterns, not the content itself.
No copyrighted text, image, or design from any referenced post is redistributed
in this repository. The templates in assets/ are original work.

If you use this skill to produce work, attribution is appreciated but not
required. If you fork it and publish the fork, keep the copyright line above.
